    id: "sc-de-quincey-cities-v2", "sights": {"de": [{"name": "My Green mansion", "text": "My Green mansion ist ein Schloss in De Quincey.", "category": "castle", "coords": [55.452436, -4.591894]}, {"name": "Beau Vallon", "text": "Beau Vallon ist ein Strand in De Quincey.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [55.42709, -4.611012]}, {"name": "Sunset Beach", "text": "Der Sunset Beach ziert den Rand von De Quincey und bietet ein reizvolles Fleckchen aus Sand und Meer. Der Strand ist ein schöner Ort, um auf dem Handtuch zu entspannen oder sich für ein beschwingtes Schwimmen ins Meer zu wagen. Viele Besucher haben Freude daran, hier an der Küste spazieren zu gehen, besonders wenn der Tag abkühlt. Seinem Namen treu bleibend, wird man für das Verweilen bis zum Abend mit spektakulären Ausblicken auf die untergehende Sonne belohnt.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [55.432612, -4.584969]}, {"name": "Tusculum Beach", "text": "Versteckt in der Region De Quincey, bietet der Tusculum Beach einen angenehmen, sandigen Rückzugsort direkt am Meer. Es ist eine fantastische Umgebung, um die Sonne der Seychellen zu genießen oder ein ruhiges, revitalisierendes Bad im Wasser zu nehmen. Ruhige Spaziergänge hier ermöglichen es Ihnen, abzuschalten und die natürliche Küstenumgebung zu genießen. Ein leichtes Picknick einzupacken ist eine großartige Möglichkeit, um das Beste aus Ihrem Nachmittag am Meer zu machen.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [55.432861, -4.581445]}, {"name": "Teddy's Glass Bottom Boat", "text": "Teddy's Glass Bottom Boat ist eine Attraktion in De Quincey.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [55.431535, -4.608184]}, {"name": "La Bastille", "text": "La Bastille ist eine Sehenswürdigkeit in De Quincey.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [55.458211, -4.610422]}, {"name": "anchor", "text": "Anchor ist ein Denkmal in De Quincey.", "category": "historical", "coords": [55.457755, -4.620349]}, {"name": "Domus", "text": "La Domus ist ein Denkmal in De Quincey.", "category": "historical", "coords": [55.451018, -4.619465]}], "hu": [{"name": "My Green mansion", "text": "A My Green mansion egy kastély De Quincey településen.", "category": "castle", "coords": [55.452436, -4.591894]}, {"name": "Beau Vallon", "text": "A Beau Vallon egy strand De Quincey településen.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [55.42709, -4.611012]}, {"name": "Sunset Beach", "text": "A Sunset Beach De Quincey szélét díszíti, kellemes kis szegletet kínálva homokból és tengerből. A strand kiváló helyszín a törölközőn való pihenéshez, vagy egy könnyed úszáshoz az óceánban. Sok látogató leli örömét a part menti sétákban ezen a helyen, különösen akkor, amikor a nap hűlni kezd. Nevéhez hűen, ha estig elidőzünk, látványos kilátás nyílik a lemenő napra, amiért érdemes itt maradni.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [55.432612, -4.584969]}, {"name": "Tusculum Beach", "text": "A De Quincey régióban elrejtett Tusculum Beach kellemes homokos menedéket nyújt a tenger mellett. Fantasztikus környezet a Seychelle-szigetek napsütésének élvezetéhez, vagy egy nyugodt, revitalizáló csobbanáshoz a vízben. A csendes séták itt lehetővé teszik a kikapcsolódást és a természetes tengerparti környezet élvezetét. Egy könnyű piknik becsomagolása nagyszerű módja annak, hogy a legtöbbet hozza ki a tengerparti délutánból.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [55.432861, -4.581445]}, {"name": "Teddy's Glass Bottom Boat", "text": "A Teddy's Glass Bottom Boat egy látványosság De Quincey településen.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [55.431535, -4.608184]}, {"name": "La Bastille", "text": "A La Bastille egy látványosság De Quincey településen.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [55.458211, -4.610422]}, {"name": "anchor", "text": "Az Anchor egy emlékmű De Quincey településen.", "category": "historical", "coords": [55.457755, -4.620349]}, {"name": "Domus", "text": "A La Domus egy emlékmű De Quincey településen.", "category": "historical", "coords": [55.451018, -4.619465]}], "ro": [{"name": "My Green mansion", "text": "My Green mansion este un castel în De Quincey.", "category": "castle", "coords": [55.452436, -4.591894]}, {"name": "Beau Vallon", "text": "Beau Vallon este o plajă în De Quincey.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [55.42709, -4.611012]}, {"name": "Sunset Beach", "text": "Sunset Beach împodobește marginea zonei De Quincey, oferind un colț încântător de nisip și mare. Plaja este o locație excelentă pentru a vă relaxa pe prosop sau pentru a vă avânta într-o sesiune de înot în ocean. Mulți vizitatori se bucură de plimbări de-a lungul coastei aici, mai ales când ziua începe să se răcească. Fidelă numelui său, zăbovirea până seara vă răsplătește cu vederi spectaculoare ale soarelui la apus.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [55.432612, -4.584969]}, {"name": "Tusculum Beach", "text": "Ascunsă în regiunea De Quincey, plaja Tusculum oferă un refugiu nisipos plăcut de-a lungul mării. Este un cadru fantastic pentru a îmbrățișa soarele din Seychelles sau pentru a face o baie calmă și revitalizantă în apă. Făcând plimbări liniștite aici vă permite să vă deconectați și să vă bucurați de mediul natural al țărmului. Împachetarea unui picnic ușor este o modalitate excelentă de a profita la maximum de după-amiaza petrecută la malul mării.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [55.432861, -4.581445]}, {"name": "Teddy's Glass Bottom Boat", "text": "Teddy's Glass Bottom Boat este o atracție în De Quincey.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [55.431535, -4.608184]}, {"name": "La Bastille", "text": "La Bastille este o atracție în De Quincey.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [55.458211, -4.610422]}, {"name": "anchor", "text": "Anchor este un monument în De Quincey.", "category": "historical", "coords": [55.457755, -4.620349]}, {"name": "Domus", "text": "La Domus este un monument în De Quincey.", "category": "historical", "coords": [55.451018, -4.619465]}], "en": [{"name": "My Green mansion", "text": "My Green mansion is a castle in De Quincey.", "category": "castle", "coords": [55.452436, -4.591894]}, {"name": "Beau Vallon", "text": "Beau Vallon is a beach located in De Quincey.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [55.42709, -4.611012]}, {"name": "Sunset Beach", "text": "Sunset Beach graces the edge of De Quincey, offering a delightful pocket of sand and sea. The beach is a fine location for unwinding on your towel or venturing out for a buoyant swim in the ocean. Many visitors take pleasure in walking along the coast here, especially as the day begins to cool. True to its name, lingering until evening rewards you with spectacular views of the setting sun.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [55.432612, -4.584969]}, {"name": "Tusculum Beach", "text": "Tucked away in the De Quincey region, Tusculum Beach provides a pleasant sandy retreat alongside the sea. It is a fantastic setting to embrace the Seychelles sun or to take a calm, revitalizing dip in the water. Taking quiet strolls here allows you to disconnect and enjoy the natural shoreline environment. Packing a light picnic is a great way to make the most of your seaside afternoon.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [55.432861, -4.581445]}, {"name": "Teddy's Glass Bottom Boat", "text": "Teddy's Glass Bottom Boat is an attraction in De Quincey.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [55.431535, -4.608184]}, {"name": "La Bastille", "text": "La Bastille is an attraction in De Quincey.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [55.458211, -4.610422]}, {"name": "anchor", "text": "Anchor is a monument located in De Quincey.", "category": "historical", "coords": [55.457755, -4.620349]}, {"name": "La Domus", "text": "La Domus is a monument located in De Quincey.", "category": "historical", "coords": [55.451018, -4.619465]}]},
